      "type": "solution",
      "difficulty": 2,
      "content": "$f(x,y) = x^2y^3$，求所有二阶偏导数 fxx,fxy,fyx,fyy，并验证 fxy =fyx。",
      "answer": "$f_{xx} = 2y^3, f_{xy} = f_{yx} = 6xy^2, f_{yy} = 6x^2y$",
      "solutionSteps": [
        "$f_x = 2xy^3, f_y = 3x^2y^2$",
        "$fxx = \\partial(fx)/\\partial x = 2y^3$",
